Now if delivery service fails during rush ?

in some sales on particular service per bhohot traffic aya ho to kuch bhi ek servce fail ho jayega -  if delivery service fails or getting more time to respose ese hum bolae hai --       CASCADING FAILURE bolate hai

solution is circuit breaker pattern

the circuit breaker pattern is use to prevent cascading failures when a microservice is slow failing or overloaded instead of waiting indefinitely it stops calls to the faling service and allows it to recover.

- ek services ke wajh se sare services ko slow down hone se bacha sakate hai

*if paymnet service fails multiple times the circuit breaker opens

*new request are rejected immeditly instead waiting

*after some time it tries again (half open state)

*if the service recover normal operation resumes

