open , half open , closed

closed - everytingis normal
open - fail hota hai to circuit open karat hai
half open - thode der bad aur ek bar try karega agar

it will return fallback response

notes -

Circuit Breaker (Short):

A Circuit Breaker is a fault-tolerance pattern that stops requests to a failed or slow service and returns a fallback response instead.

Benefits:

Prevents cascading failures
Improves response time during outages
Allows failed services time to recover

Flow:
Client → API Gateway → Service
If Service fails → Circuit Breaker opens → Fallback response returned.

